{
  "action": "In general, a standard system update will make all the necessary changes.",
  "cves": [
    "CVE-2025-57812",
    "CVE-2025-64503"
  ],
  "description": "It was discovered that libcupsfilters incorrectly handled certain malformed\nTIFF image files. A remote attacker could use this issue to cause\nlibcupsfilters to crash, resulting in a denial of service, or possibly\nexecute arbitrary code. (CVE-2025-57812)\n\nIt was discovered that libcupsfilters incorrectly handled certain malformed\nPDF document files. A remote attacker could use this issue to cause\nlibcupsfilters to crash, resulting in a denial of service, or possibly\nexecute arbitrary code. (CVE-2025-64503)",
  "id": "USN-7877-1",
  "isummary": "Several security issues were fixed in libcupsfilters.",
